<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
 	The Adsum Crew Jacket is a patch pocket Harrington style constructed from heavy 100% cotton twill that shares the same quality from this seasons Bank Pant. This style first made an appearance in SS19 as an unlined version in a very light fabric. 	
    Ever since then, we wanted to make a more heavyweight version. We increased fabric the weight and improved finishing quality of the jacket by lining both color combinations of the jacket with custom poplin plaids. 
    Sitting on top of the YKK metal zip front closure are high shine laser etched poly horn buttons that secure a throat tab closure. The waistband and cuffs of the jacket are cinched by an internal elastic to keep drafts out. 
	A self fabric locker loop is cleanly set into the neckline securing your jacket wherever you need to stow it. Available in Khaki and Dark Navy.
  </p>
